{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"yuanzhang-e-o057","title":"田畴劝父老推择贤长者以为之主，众同佥推畴","accounts":[{"id":"yuanzhang-a-ea6dd158fcf270ac190f","label":"正文","text":"田畴劝父老推择贤长者以为之主，众同佥推畴","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-5d0e81ef25962030b9ec"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-40de896b2dd769bb702b","label":"正文","text":"田畴言今来在此将图大事复怨雪耻，愿共施愚计，皆曰可","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-3966545eca28db7a6596"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-fb59b81cadf8aebc7f10","label":"正文","text":"田畴为约束杀伤犯盗诤讼之法二十余条，制婚姻嫁娶之礼，兴学校讲授之业，众皆便之至道不拾遗","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-b6d053cf39caacbb6c2c"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0243","role":"劝父老莫相统一恐非久安之道，愿推择贤长者以为之主，众同佥推畴；言非苟安而已，将图大事复怨雪耻，请与诸君共施愚计；为法二十余条，制婚姻嫁娶之礼，兴举学校讲授之业，班行其众","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-5d0e81ef25962030b9ec","yuanzhang-q-3966545eca28db7a6596","yuanzhang-q-b6d053cf39caacbb6c2c"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-5d0e81ef25962030b9ec","yuanzhang-q-3966545eca28db7a6596","yuanzhang-q-b6d053cf39caacbb6c2c"]},"ordering_evidence":"yuanzhang-q-5d0e81ef25962030b9ec","source_order":[11,202,0],"order":2581}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0243","name":"田畴","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"yuanzhang-q-3966545eca28db7a6596","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-36aa391a84a053bfb3cc","layer":"original","quote":"畴曰：“今来在此，非苟安而已；将图大事，复怨雪耻。窃恐未得其志，而轻薄之徒自相侵侮，偷快一时〖4〗，无深计远虑。畴有愚计，愿与诸君共施之，可乎？”皆曰：“可！”","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":68,"end":148,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-5d0e81ef25962030b9ec","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-36aa391a84a053bfb3cc","layer":"original","quote":"畴谓其父老曰：“诸君不以畴不肖，远来相就，众成都邑〖3〗。而莫相统一，恐非久安之道；愿推择其贤长者，以为之主。”皆曰：“善！”同佥推畴","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-b6d053cf39caacbb6c2c","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-59f480f7b760fdcfc9e0","layer":"original","quote":"畴乃为约束相杀伤、犯盗、诤讼之法；法重者，至死，其次抵罪〖5〗：二十余条。又制为婚姻嫁娶之礼，兴举学校讲授之业；班行其众，众皆便之，至道不拾遗","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":202,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
